[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1080","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1088","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 扩展存储过程参数解析缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 及 SQL Server Desktop Engine (MSDE) 中的 xp_SetSQLSecurity 扩展存储过程函数在调用 srv_paraminfo API 前未正确限制缓冲区长度，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该函数传递特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝响应或执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，但需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。Microsoft 尚未发布官方补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1088"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-092 提供的补丁。SQL Server 7.0 用户需先升级至 Service Pack 2 再安装补丁；SQL Server 2000 用户可直接安装补丁，后续补丁将包含在 Service Pack 1 中。如无法立即打补丁，可将 SQL Server 服务账号配置为普通用户权限（非管理员），以限制利用成功后代码的执行权限；同时在防火墙层面限制对 SQL Server 端口的访问，仅允许受信任主机连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570884410184&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2043","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1088.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1088.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1088.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1088.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1088.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1088","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1088.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1088.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1088.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1088.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1079","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1087","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 扩展存储过程参数解析缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 及 MSDE 中的 xp_proxiedmetadata 扩展存储过程函数在调用 srv_paraminfo API 时未正确限制缓冲区长度，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地认证攻击者可通过向该函数传递特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝或执行任意命令，获取目标系统的控制权限。该漏洞被命名为\"扩展存储过程参数解析\"漏洞，影响 SQL Server 2000 及 MSDE 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1087"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-092 提供的官方补丁。SQL Server 7.0 用户需升级至 Service Pack 3，SQL Server 2000 用户需升级至 Service Pack 1。如无法立即打补丁，应限制对 SQL Server 的登录权限，确保 SQL Server 服务以最低权限用户账户运行而非管理员账户，并禁用不必要的扩展存储过程（XP）以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570884410184&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2042","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1087.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1087.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1087.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1087.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1087.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1087","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1087.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1087.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1087.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1087.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1078","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1086","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 扩展存储过程参数解析缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 及 MSDE 中的 xp_printstatements 扩展存储过程函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数在调用 srv_paraminfo API 前未正确验证输入缓冲区长度，允许拥有本地登录权限的攻击者向 SQL Server 发送特制的参数数据触发缓冲区溢出，进而导致服务拒绝或执行任意命令。攻击者需先通过身份认证登录数据库系统，利用条件较为受限，但一旦成功可完全控制数据库服务器进程。此漏洞又名\"扩展存储过程参数解析\"漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1086"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07Z","remediation":"立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-092 提供的补丁（SQL Server 2000 补丁后续包含在 Service Pack 1 中，SQL Server 7.0 补丁包含在 Service Pack 3 中）。如无法立即打补丁，应将 SQL Server 服务账号配置为普通用户权限而非管理员权限，以限制利用成功后的影响范围；同时检查所有第三方扩展存储过程（XP）在调用 srv_paraminfo() 前是否正确分配了足够大小的缓冲区。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570884410184&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2041","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1086.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1086.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1086.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1086.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1086.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1086","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1086.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1086.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1086.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1086.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1077","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1084","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 扩展存储过程参数解析缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 及 MSDE 中的 xp_updatecolvbm 扩展存储过程函数在调用 srv_paraminfo API 前未正确限制缓冲区长度，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地认证攻击者可通过向该函数传递特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 SQL Server 7.0 及 MSDE 1.0 等版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，需本地登录后利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1084"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-092 提供的补丁。SQL Server 7.0 用户需先升级至 Service Pack 2 再安装此补丁，后续将包含在 SP3 中；SQL Server 2000 用户可直接安装补丁，后续将包含在 SP1 中。如无法立即打补丁，应限制对 SQL Server 的登录权限，确保 SQL Server 服务账户仅具有普通用户权限而非管理员权限，并检查所有第三方扩展存储过程（XP）对 srv_paraminfo() 的调用是否分配了足够大小的缓冲区。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570878710037&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2039","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1084.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1084.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1084.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1084.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1084.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1084","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1084.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1084.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1084.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1084.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1076","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1082","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 扩展存储过程参数解析缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 及 MSDE 中的 xp_enumresultset 扩展存储过程函数在调用 srv_paraminfo API 时未正确限制缓冲区长度，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该函数传递特制的参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标系统服务崩溃造成拒绝服务，或执行任意命令。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地登录权限才能利用，影响 SQL Server 及 MSDE 多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1082"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-092 提供的 KB280380 补丁：SQL Server 7.0 用户应升级至 Service Pack 3（含该补丁），SQL Server 2000 用户应升级至 Service Pack 1（含该补丁）。如无法立即打补丁，应将 SQL Server 服务账号配置为普通用户权限而非管理员权限，以限制攻击者获取代码执行权限后的影响范围；同时在防火墙层面限制对 SQL Server 端口的非必要访问，并禁用不必要的扩展存储过程作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570878710037&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2031","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1082.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1082.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1082.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1082.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1082.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1082","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1082.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1082.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1082.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1082.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1059","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1039","title":"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.\n\nThe validator says \"description: description 字段为空\" — but actually the current TOML has the description content inside a multi-line string after \"tags. Must be Chinese...\". This looks like malformed content where the AI's scaffolding text (\"tags. Must be Chinese, ≥50 chars...\") got prepended into the description.\n\nMy task: output the fixed description value between <value> tags. I need to provide a clean Chinese description ≥50 chars covering principle, scope, attack conditions.\n\nLet me just provide a clean description.<value>CVE-2000-1039 属于被统称为\"NAPTHA\"的拒绝服务漏洞类别，涉及多种 TCP/IP 协议栈及网络应用程序。漏洞原理是：远程攻击者向目标主机持续发送大量 TCP 连接尝试请求，并顺利完成 TCP/IP 三次握手建立连接，但在攻击者一方不维护连接状态、不发后续数据也不释放资源，导致目标主机被迫为海量已建立的悬空连接保留内核资源（内存、套接字、文件描述符等），最终因资源耗尽无法处理正常请求，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响未打补丁的 Windows 95/98/98SE/NT 4.0 等操作系统，以及各类存在连接管理缺陷的网络应用。攻击条件为无需任何认证，远程即可实施，仅需目标主机可达，利用门槛较低，可严重破坏受害主机的可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1039"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01Z","remediation":"建议尽快安装微软针对该漏洞发布的最新补丁。对于 Windows NT 4.0，需升级至包含 TCP/IP 栈补丁的服务包（如 Service Pack 6a 后续的累积更新）并同步更新系统文件；对于 Windows 95/98/98SE，请安装微软官方提供的网络组件修复更新包。由于攻击本质是攻击者以海量 TCP 半连接耗尽目标系统资源（NAPTHA 攻击族），在无法及时打补丁时，可在边界防火墙/路由器上配置连接速率限制与超时阈值，并启用 SYN Cookie 防护以缓解 TCP 半开放连接洪泛；同时对内网主机部署入侵检测系统，检测异常的 TCP 半连接流量并进行告警与限流。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0105.html","http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_NAPTHA.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-21.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2022","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-091","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1039.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1039.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1039.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1039.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1039","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1039.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1039.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1039.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1039.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1039.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1002","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0899","title":"Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 2.01 HTTP 请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 2.01 存在 HTTP 请求拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向服务器建立连接后，连续发送多个 GET、HEAD 或 POST 请求，并在服务器响应前主动关闭连接，导致服务器资源耗尽或处理逻辑异常，从而触发拒绝服务状态。该漏洞影响 Small HTTP Server 2.01 版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用方式简单，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0899"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43Z","remediation":"立即升级 Small HTTP Server 至 2.03 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙或主机防火墙中限制对 Small HTTP Server 端口（默认 80）的访问，仅允许可信来源 IP 连接；同时禁用 SSI（Server-Side Includes）功能，避免解析恶意 SSI 标签导致服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97421834001092&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1942","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0899","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2000/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0899.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0899.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1002.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1001","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0898","title":"Small HTTP Server 空值SSI标签处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Small HTTP Server 2.01 在处理包含空值的服务器端包含（SSI）标签时存在安全缺陷，未能正确解析此类特殊构造的标签内容。本地用户或远程攻击者可通过向服务器提交嵌入了恶意 SSI 标签的 HTML 文件触发该漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响 Small HTTP Server 2.01 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0898"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43Z","remediation":"将 Small HTTP Server 升级至 2.03 或更高版本，此版本已修复 SSI 标签对空值的异常处理问题。如业务无需 SSI 功能，可在配置文件中关闭 SSI 支持以彻底消除风险。若暂无法升级，应确保所有含 SSI 指令的文件仅使用 .shtm 或 .shtml 扩展名，并对用户输入中的空字符进行过滤校验，防止恶意构造的 SSI 标签被注入 HTML 文件导致服务器崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97421834001092&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0898","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c3d516d6bc446725f6492ed800c677df20d0d39c/2000/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0898.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/7bec7ab13a920b5bdca1b43ac1859f030aec77a0/api/2000/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0898.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1001.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0931","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0931.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1189","title":"Red Hat Linux pam_localuser 模块缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Red Hat Linux 7.x 及 6.x 系统中的 pam_localuser PAM 模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该模块用于本地用户认证时将用户名复制到固定大小的缓冲区，由于缺少足够的边界检查，攻击者可构造超长字符串导致缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖内存中的关键数据。该漏洞影响使用 pam_localuser 模块的 Red Hat Linux 6.x 和 7.x 系列版本。攻击条件为攻击者需获得本地系统访问权限，可通过构造特制的输入数据触发溢出，成功利用后可能获得系统 root 权限，实现本地权限提升，对系统的机密性、完整性和可用性造成严重影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1189"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20Z","remediation":"建议升级 pam 软件包到修复版本（Red Hat 7.0 需更新至 pam-0.75-3 及以上，Red Hat 6.x/7.x 请安装对应 RHSA 勘误公告中的 pam 更新包）。可通过 Red Hat Network 或 `rpm -Uvh pam-*.rpm` 手动安装补丁包后重启相关服务。由于 pam_localuser 模块是本地登录认证的关键组件，该漏洞可导致本地权限提升，受影响系统均为已停止维护的老版本，强烈建议迁移至仍受支持的操作系统版本，避免长期暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000358","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-082.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-120.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5747","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1189","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/47bb69b00d30a4ddac9a224d4b4672d3efbf78ef/2000/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1189.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1189.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0931.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0930","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0930.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1187","title":"Netscape Communicator/Navigator HTML解析器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netscape 4.75 及更早版本的 HTML 解析器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在表单字段中提交超长密码值触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。攻击者只需诱使用户访问特制网页即可完成利用，无需身份认证。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 Netscape 浏览器的系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1187"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Netscape 4.75 及更早版本，升级至 Netscape 6.0 或更高版本。由于 Netscape 浏览器已停止维护，建议彻底迁移至现代浏览器（如 Firefox、Chrome 或 Edge）。在完成迁移前，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 和自动表单填充功能，并配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）过滤包含超长表单字段的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000344","http://lists.suse.com/archives/suse-security-announce/2000-Nov/0005.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97500270012529&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/7207","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-109.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5542","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1187","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2000/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1187.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1187.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0930.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0930.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0930.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0929","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0929.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1178","title":"Joe 文本编辑器 DEADJOE 符号链接跟随漏洞","description":"Joe 文本编辑器在异常退出时创建名为 DEADJOE 的恢复副本时会跟随符号链接，导致本地攻击者可通过创建指向其他用户文件的符号链接，诱使受害者运行 Joe 编辑器并触发异常退出，从而覆盖目标用户的任意文件。该漏洞影响所有使用 Joe 编辑器的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5（中等），攻击向量为本地、低权限、无需用户交互，主要影响文件完整性（完整性影响高）。攻击者需具备本地账户权限并能诱导目标用户运行 Joe 编辑器，利用方式为预先创建指向敏感文件的符号链接 DEADJOE，待目标用户异常退出编辑器时触发文件覆盖。该漏洞属于 CWE-59 符号链接跟随类漏洞，建议升级至修复版本的 Joe 编辑器或限制普通用户对符号链接的创建权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1178"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"升级 Joe 编辑器到 2.9.8 或更高版本（该版本修复了 DEADJOE 符号链接跟随漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可通过设置环境变量 JOE_NOSYMLINKS=1 禁用符号链接跟随，或在 /etc/joe/joerc 中添加 -nosymlinks 选项禁用救援副本的符号链接跟随功能。建议同时设置用户 umask 077 限制救援文件权限，防止其他用户读写。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0227.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000356","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97500174210821&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001201","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-072.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-110.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1959","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5546","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1178","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7b3c5ee5be30197db078d8e847336c0178ebe3f4/2000/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1178.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1178.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0929.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0928","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0928.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1169","title":"OpenSSH SSH客户端 X11转发与agent转发权限访问漏洞","description":"OpenSSH SSH客户端2.3.0之前版本未正确禁用X11转发或agent转发功能，恶意SSH服务器可利用此漏洞获取客户端X11显示访问权限并窥探X11事件，或获取ssh-agent的访问权限，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者只需搭建恶意SSH服务器并诱导用户连接即可实施攻击，无需任何认证，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1169"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 客户端至 2.3.0 或更高版本，该版本默认禁用 X11 转发和 agent 转发。如无法升级，连接不可信 SSH 服务器时使用 `-x` 参数禁用 X11 转发、使用 `-a` 参数禁用 agent 转发，或在 `~/.ssh/config` 中设置 `ForwardX11 no` 和 `ForwardAgent no` 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0195.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0217.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000345","http://lists.suse.com/archives/suse-security-announce/2000-Nov/0004.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001118","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-068.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/2114","http://www.osvdb.org/6248","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-111.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1949","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5517","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1169","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2000/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1169.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/2000/CVE-2000-1169.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0928.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0926","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0926.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1162","title":"Ghostscript Ghostscript 符号链接导致的文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Ghostscript 在 5.10-16 之前的版本中存在文件覆盖漏洞。该漏洞的原理在于程序在处理文件输出时未能正确验证符号链接（symlink），导致本地攻击者可以通过创建指向其他用户或系统关键文件的符号链接，诱导 Ghostscript 将输出内容写入该链接指向的目标路径。在具有本地访问权限的情况下，攻击者可利用此漏洞覆盖其他用户的合法文件或关键系统配置文件，从而实现权限提升或导致系统不稳定。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1162"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:17Z","remediation":"建议将 Ghostscript 升级到 5.10-16 或更高版本以修复符号链接漏洞。在无法立即升级的环境中，可以通过配置严格的文件系统权限，限制本地低权限用户在共享临时目录中创建符号链接，从而降低被攻击的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000343","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-041.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001123","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-074.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-114.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1990","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5563","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1162","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1e9aa0e87d4eb1e9f99e0f5b9c02665ba8ee98ef/2000/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1162.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-1162.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0926.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0924","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0924.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1137","title":"GNU ed 符号链接攻击文件覆盖漏洞","description":"该漏洞源于GNU ed编辑器在处理文件时存在设计缺陷。GNU ed工具在写入文件时未妥善验证文件路径，导致攻击者可通过创建精心设计的符号链接诱骗程序覆盖其他用户的重要文件。具体攻击过程为：攻击者首先创建指向目标文件（如/etc/passwd、/etc/shadow等）的符号链接，随后在执行GNU ed操作时，程序会意外地将编辑内容写入到被符号链接指向的文件中，从而破坏文件完整性、窃取敏感数据，甚至获取系统控制权。该漏洞影响所有使用GNU ed的Linux系统用户，具有较高的系统危害性。攻击者无需网络连接，仅需本地权限即可实施攻击，对系统安全构成严重威胁。同时，由于该漏洞破坏系统文件完整性，可能导致系统崩溃或权限提升，进而影响整个系统的可用性和机密性。目前安全维护人员建议及时更新GNU ed至安全版本，并限制普通用户对敏感文件的访问权限。相关安全补丁已在GNU最新版本中修复，使用GNU ed的系统管理员应立即进行版本升级。最终，本次漏洞虽然不属于极高危，但由于其影响面广且可导致严重后果，因此仍需高度重视并采取相应防护措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1137"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GNU ed 至 0.2-18.1 或更高版本（当前主流发行版已提供 1.22+），Debian 执行 `apt update && apt install --only-upgrade ed`，RHEL/CentOS 执行 `yum update ed`，Fedora 执行 `dnf update ed`。若暂时无法升级，避免在 /tmp 等世界可写目录使用 ed 编辑他人文件，禁止以 root 权限运行 ed 编辑非受信文件，为共享目录配置 sticky bit（`chmod +t /tmp`）防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000359","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001129","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-076.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/6491","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-123.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5723","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1137","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f187e7be682488cc782059fd6bb7b453289ef42b/2000/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1137.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-1137.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0924.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0837","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0837.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1186","title":"PHF CGI 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PHF CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者通过向 CGI 程序提交大量参数并包含超长 MIME 头部，可触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Linux/x86 平台上的 PHF 组件，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1186"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20Z","remediation":"立即从 Web 服务器 CGI 目录中删除或禁用 phf 程序，该程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞且已不再维护，建议使用更安全的替代方案或完全移除该 CGI 组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0221.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5970","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/211","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1186","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2000/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1186.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1186.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0837.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0837.toml"}]